      "title": "Sir Zelman Cowen Dean of Law",
      "description": "The Sir Zelman Cowen Dean of Law is the academic and civic leader of one of Australia’s most purpose‑driven law schools, based in the heart of Melbourne’s legal precinct. The role leads the Law School’s strategy, people, curriculum, research and partnerships shaping an accessible, applied legal education that delivers real community and societal impact. Named in honour of Sir Zelman Cowen, the Dean stewards a legacy of principled legal thought, public service and inclusive education, while advancing innovation in learning, strong industry and government connections, and a nationally recognised public intellectual program.",
