      "title": "Teaching Focused Academic Mechanical Engineering",
      "description": "We are seeking an enthusiastic and committed Teaching Focused Academic Mechanical Engineering to join the College of Sport, Health and Engineering. This continuing Level B role is focused on high quality teaching within VU's modernised Engineering curriculum, with particular emphasis on contemporary Mechanical Engineering practice, integrated and project based learning, student success and strong industry connection. VU's Strategic Plan 2022-2030 sets the ambition to be one of the leading impact driven universities in the world by 2030.",
      "department": null
    },
